## 7. Directory & Modular Architecture
Structure every 3D project cleanly so scene logic, shaders, and DOM overlays stay decoupled:
```text
src/
├── components/
│   ├── canvas/
│   │   ├── Scene.tsx           # Persistent R3F Canvas, Camera, PostProcessing
│   │   ├── Lighting.tsx        # HDRI Environment + Lightformers + Shadows
│   │   ├── HeroArtifact.tsx    # Main interactive 3D centerpiece
│   │   └── CameraRig.tsx       # Scroll-linked spline + mouse parallax rig
│   ├── dom/
│   │   ├── SmoothScroll.tsx    # Lenis + GSAP ScrollTrigger bridge
│   │   ├── Preloader.tsx       # Asset progress counter + curtain reveal
│   │   ├── CustomCursor.tsx    # Lerped magnetic cursor
│   │   └── OverlaySections.tsx # Editorial HTML sections synced to scroll
├── shaders/
│   ├── hero.vert.glsl          # Simplex/Curl noise vertex displacement
│   └── hero.frag.glsl          # Fresnel rim lighting, iridescence, grain
└── store/
    └── useExperienceStore.ts   # Zustand store (non-reactive refs for 60fps loop)